        "template--16391993786425__152a2012-b736-4050-8930-de1e243822ed-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>King Gold, established in 1982, has grown from a small workshop to become one of the largest gold jewelry manufacturers in Egypt. With a large factory and numerous authorized distributors across the country, King Gold employs over 500 skilled workers and staff members. The brand is renowned for its elegant, modern, luxurious, and unique jewelry designs.</p><p>King Gold’s product range is extensive, offering pieces that start from less than 1 gram up to 500 grams, catering to a diverse array of customer preferences and needs. In addition to its impressive craftsmanship, King Gold exclusively uses 18k gold, ensuring high quality and durability in every piece.</p>",
